    "option_selection": "Choose the option that best satisfies both indication and patient-specific safety. Prioritize options that are recognized treatments for the diagnosed condition. When multiple options are indicated, prefer the one that is most specific to the diagnosis and avoids unnecessary broad-spectrum or purely symptomatic agents. Do not select an option solely because it addresses a symptom or secondary issue."
  }
}

