      "text": "First filter options to those indicated for the diagnosed condition. Then, among indicated options, prefer the one that does not duplicate or antagonize the patient's current therapy and does not introduce a known contraindication. If no option is perfectly indicated, choose the one with the strongest indication and least conflict with current medications."
    }
